# Goal
string prompt   # Assembled prompt / context to reason over
string schema   # Optional JSON shape/schema hint the reply must match; empty = free-form text
sensor_msgs/CompressedImage[] images   # Optional frames to reason over (empty = text-only); order is meaningful (e.g. before, after)
---
# Result
string response
# Stamp of the current-view frame reasoned over (images[-1]); zero when text-only.
builtin_interfaces/Time stamp
---
# Feedback
string state
